  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Ol eksampol blong kod, JSON Schema, mo ol templet blong polisi we masin i save ridim, oli gat laesens aninit long MIT Laesens, sipos i no gat wan narafala steitmen. Yu fri blong deployem olgeta long sait blong yu wan.",
