  "Commercial use requires contact": "Yusum Blong Bisnes i Nidim Yu Kontaktem Mifala",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Oli komisenem hem afta Bletchley AI Safety Summit, mo Yoshua Bengio i lidim wok wetem moa long 100 ekspat we oli kontribiut, oli kamaot long klosap 30 kantri plas UN, OECD mo EU, mo indipenden ripot ia i putum tugeta ol saentifik evidens naoia abaotem ol kapabiliti mo risik blong frontia AI — i notisim se sam sistem naoia oli save faenemaot taem oli stap testim olgeta, mo jenisim fasin blong olgeta folem.",
  "Companion media": "Media We i Go Wetem",
