  "Convert rights declarations into a workable licensing market instead of a binary open/closed web.": "Tanem ol stetmen blong raet i kam wan maket blong laesensing we i save wok, i no jas wan Wep we i open-o-klos nomo.",
  "Copied ✓": "Kopi Finis ✓",
