  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Stret pozisen: indipenden draft blong risej, propozol blong protokol, mo wan eksperimen blong open spesifikesen.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Stretem bak wan default bifo: Belgium (BE) naoia i go long Dutch, i no French — pipol we oli tok Flemish oli mekemap mejoriti blong kantri (~60%) winim ol Walloon we oli tok French (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Stretem bak wan default bifo: Kazakhstan (KZ) naoia i go long Kazakh, i no Russian, naoia we translesen blong Kazakh i eksis — semfala kaen fiks olsem stretem bifo blong Belgium.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
